sequenceDiagram
 actor User
 participant UI as Angular workspace
 participant API as Fake API application
 participant Inv as InventoryItem
 participant Store as File or IndexedDB adapter
 User->>UI: Receive 2 of 4 ordered units
 UI->>API: POST /purchases/id/receipts
 API->>Inv: receive(Quantity(2))
 API->>Store: Commit receipt + lines + movement + balance
 API-->>UI: 201 / PARTIAL
 User->>UI: Sell 2 units
 UI->>API: POST /sales with productId and quantity
 API->>Inv: ensureSellable / issue(Quantity(2))
 API->>Store: Commit sale + lines + payment + demo receipt + movements
 API-->>UI: 201 / CONFIRMED
 User->>UI: Assign sale, driver, vehicle and destination
 UI->>API: POST /dispatches
 API->>Store: Commit manifest + lines + destination stop
 User->>UI: Start route, then confirm recipient
 UI->>API: PATCH IN_TRANSIT, then DELIVERED
 API->>Store: Commit status + successful delivery attempt
 API-->>UI: 200 / DELIVERED
